                               <property name="toolTip">
                                <string>&lt;b&gt;End Time&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the last epoch (in GPS time) in the observation file to be processed. Once this epoch has been processed, no more epochs will be read from the observation file.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; In the GUI, the date format is fixed, but in command line there are four different date formats:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS (in 24 hour format)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;YYYY/MM/DD HH:MM:SS (in 24 hour format)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;YYYY/DoY SoD&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;GPSWeek SoW&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
