                             <string>&lt;b&gt;Receiver ANTEX File:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Selects a secondary ANTEX file for receiver antenna phase centre information. A seconday ANTEX file is useful when satellite and receiver antenna phase centre information are split in two files.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Receiver data read in this secondary ANTEX file will be appended to the receiver data read in the main ANTEX file.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ANTEX files can be found in the links provided in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Other Files&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;</string>
