                             <item row="0" column="0" rowspan="3">
                              <widget class="QFrame" name="frame_6">
                               <property name="frameShape">
                                <enum>QFrame::NoFrame</enum>
                               </property>
                               <property name="frameShadow">
                                <enum>QFrame::Raised</enum>
                               </property>
                               <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_44">
                                <property name="leftMargin">
                                 <number>6</number>
                                </property>
                                <property name="rightMargin">
                                 <number>6</number>
                                </property>
                                <property name="bottomMargin">
                                 <number>6</number>
                                </property>
                                <item row="0" column="0">
                                 <widget class="QComboBox" name="comboBoxRefStation">
                                  <property name="sizePolicy">
                                   <sizepolicy hsizetype="Minimum" vsizetype="Fixed">
                                    <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                                    <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                                   </sizepolicy>
                                  </property>
                                  <property name="minimumSize">
                                   <size>
                                    <width>170</width>
                                    <height>0</height>
                                   </size>
                                  </property>
                                  <property name="focusPolicy">
                                   <enum>Qt::StrongFocus</enum>
                                  </property>
                                  <property name="toolTip">
                                   <string>&lt;b&gt;DGNSS reference station file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Selects the input reference station file. Supported formats are:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;RINEX observation file:&lt;/b&gt; A RINEX observation file from a fixed station with known coordinates.&lt;br&gt;RINEX Observation files can be found in the links provided in the following menus:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;RINEX Observation Files&lt;br&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;RINEX files from Institutions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li &gt;&lt;b&gt;RTCM Auto:&lt;/b&gt; In this mode gLAB will autodetect if RTCM file is version 2.x or 3.x.&lt;br&gt;RTCM files have to be downloaded from a Ntrip  (Network Transport of RTCM via Internet Protocol) server. See NTRIP server list in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Lists of NTRIP servers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li &gt;&lt;b&gt;RTCM 2.x:&lt;/b&gt; RTCM version 2. In this mode, the initial date and hour of the data has to be provided, as this information is not in the binary file.&lt;br&gt;RTCM files have to be downloaded from a Ntrip (Network Transport of RTCM via Internet Protocol) server. See NTRIP server list in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Lists of NTRIP servers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;RTCM v3.x:&lt;/b&gt; RTCM version 3. In this mode, the initial date of the data has to be provided, as this information is not in the binary file.&lt;br&gt;RTCM files have to be downloaded from a Ntrip (Network Transport of RTCM via Internet Protocol) server. See NTRIP server list in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Lists of NTRIP servers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTES:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;gLAB supports a change of reference station during DGNSS processing. In RTCM v2.x, the corrections are sent by the reference station, so its coordinates are not used. In RTCM v3.x, the reference station coordinates get updated every time the message with the reference station coordinates is read. In RINEX observation file, the user can add a new RINEX observation header with the new coordinates or add an event epoch with the  &lt;b&gt;APPROX POSITION XYZ&lt;/b&gt; record.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;To process multiple days in a single run, RINEX navigation files from multiple days must be concatenated (in chronological order) with or without header (recommended with header). To concatenate files, use the following command line instruction:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Linux/Mac/Cygwin terminal:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;cat file1 file2 file3 ... file N &gt; &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Windows terminal:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;copy /b file1+file2+...+fileN &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;File1, file2, etc, are the input files to be concatenated. &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt; is the resulting file after concatenating all input files into one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Note that gLAB does not care about filename or extensions (as gLAB will check that the file contents matches the expected one), so any filename or extension can be used for the concatenated file.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                                  </property>
                                  <item>
                                   <property name="text">
                                    <string>RINEX Observation File:</string>
                                   </property>
                                  </item>
                                  <item>
                                   <property name="text">
                                    <string>RTCM Auto:</string>
                                   </property>
                                  </item>
                                  <item>
                                   <property name="text">
                                    <string>RTCM v2.x:</string>
                                   </property>
                                  </item>
                                  <item>
                                   <property name="text">
                                    <string>RTCM v3.x:</string>
                                   </property>
                                  </item>
                                 </widget>
                                </item>
