                                      <property name="toolTip">
                                       <string>&lt;b&gt;Interpolation Degree:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the interpolation degree for computing the reference position from the data read in the file. The position will be interpolated with Lagrange interpolation (like in SP3 files). This is useful for computing a reference position in an epoch that is not provided in the file (but is between two epochs available in the file).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; For linear interpolation, set a value of 1.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                      </property>
                                      <property name="styleSheet">
