                                        <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                                        <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                                       </sizepolicy>
                                      </property>
                                      <property name="toolTip">
                                       <string>&lt;b&gt;Reference Position File for Rover:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the reference position file for the rover. It can be a SP3 file, a columnar text file or a RTKlib output file.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTES:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If file has SP3 format, then it must have data for &lt;b&gt;only one satellite&lt;/b&gt; (the constellation and PRN will be ignored).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If file is a columnar text file, the file format is described in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;User manuals-&gt;Reference Position File Manual&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                                      </property>
