                                        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_193">
                                         <property name="toolTip">
                                          <string>&lt;b&gt;GPS Receiver Type: &lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Specify a GPS receiver type. Because GPS codes are generated differently depending the GPS Receiver Type, C1-P1 biases need to be removed as follows: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt; Type 0 &lt;/b&gt; : GPS C1-P1 classification unknown. &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt; Type 1 &lt;/b&gt; : Cross correlated receiver, reporting: &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; C1 &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; P2 = C1 + (Y&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; - Y&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#C00000'&gt;  Needs Corrections to obtain P1 and a consistent P2: P1=C1+b and P2=P2+b &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt; Type 2 &lt;/b&gt; : C1 reported in place of P1: &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#C00000'&gt;  Needs Corrections to obtain P1: P1=C1+b  &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt; Type 3 &lt;/b&gt; : L1,L2,P1,P2 reported as consistent set: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#C00000'&gt;  No bias removal needed. &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;  &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; If user selects GPS receiver type 2 and GPS C1-P1 correction is set to flexible (in Modelling section), GPS C1-P1 file will not be necessary. This is to account for receivers that state in the header that GPS P1 measurement is available, but all the P1 measurements have a value of 0. When GPS receiver type 2 is set by the user, gLAB will ignore GPS P1 measurement.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                         </property>
                                         <property name="styleSheet">
                                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                         </property>
                                         <property name="text">
                                          <string>GPS Receiver Type:</string>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                       <item row="0" column="2">
