                                        <property name="toolTip">
                                         <string>&lt;b&gt;GPS Receiver Type from File&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Specify a GPS Receiver Type file, where gLAB will search for the receiver name read from the RINEX observation header record &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;REC # / TYPE / VERS&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;GPS Receiver Types files can be found in the links provided in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Other Files&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                        </property>
