                                   <item row="1" column="0" colspan="3">
                                    <widget class="QStackedWidget" name="stackedWidgetDcbSource">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string/>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="currentIndex">
                                      <number>4</number>
                                     </property>
                                     <widget class="QWidget" name="page_28">
                                      <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_53">
                                       <item row="0" column="0">
                                        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_43">
                                         <property name="text">
                                          <string/>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                      </layout>
                                     </widget>
                                     <widget class="QWidget" name="page_13">
                                      <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_26">
                                       <property name="leftMargin">
                                        <number>0</number>
                                       </property>
                                       <property name="rightMargin">
                                        <number>0</number>
                                       </property>
                                       <item row="0" column="0">
                                        <widget class="QLabel" name="labelInputRinexNavDCBFile">
                                         <property name="toolTip">
                                          <string>&lt;b&gt;RINEX navigation file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Selects the input RINEX navigation file for obtaining DCB corrections. It supports RINEX formats 2.11 and 3.00.&lt;br&gt;RINEX navigation files can be found in the links provided in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;RINEX Navigation Files&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; To process multiple days in a single run, RINEX navigation files from multiple days must be concatenated (in chronological order) with or without header (recommended with header). To concatenate files, use the following command line instruction:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Linux/Mac/Cygwin terminal:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;cat file1 file2 file3 ... file N &gt; &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Windows terminal:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;copy /b file1+file2+...+fileN &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;File1, file2, etc, are the input files to be concatenated. &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt; is the resulting file after concatenating all input files into one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Note that gLAB does not care about filename or extensions (as gLAB will check that the file contents matches the expected one), so any filename or extension can be used for the concatenated file.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                         </property>
                                         <property name="styleSheet">
                                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                         </property>
                                         <property name="text">
                                          <string>RINEX Nav. File:</string>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                       <item row="0" column="1">
                                        <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditDcbSourceRinexNav">
                                         <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                          <bool>true</bool>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                       <item row="0" column="2">
                                        <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonDcbSourceRinexNav">
                                         <property name="text">
                                          <string>...</string>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                      </layout>
                                     </widget>
                                     <widget class="QWidget" name="page_14">
                                      <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_54">
                                       <property name="leftMargin">
