                                        <number>0</number>
                                       </property>
                                       <item row="0" column="0">
                                        <widget class="QLabel" name="labelInputDCBP1P2File">
                                         <property name="toolTip">
                                          <string>&lt;b&gt;Precise DCB File&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A precise .DCB file where an accurate estimation of the (P1-P2) bias (for GPS and GLONASS only) is provided. This file contains a monthly estimation of the (P1-P2) Differential Code Bias (&lt;b&gt;DCB&lt;/b&gt;) for all GPS/GLONASS Satellites.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;These DCB files can be found in the links provided in the following menu:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Help-&amp;gt;Download data files-&amp;gt;Other Files&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                         </property>
                                         <property name="styleSheet">
                                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                         </property>
                                         <property name="text">
                                          <string>DCB File:</string>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                       <item row="0" column="1">
                                        <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditDcbSourceDcb">
                                         <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                          <bool>true</bool>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                       <item row="0" column="2">
                                        <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonDcbSourceDcb">
                                         <property name="text">
                                          <string>...</string>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                      </layout>
                                     </widget>
                                     <widget class="QWidget" name="page_29">
                                      <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_56">
                                       <item row="0" column="0">
                                        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_45">
                                         <property name="text">
                                          <string/>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                      </layout>
                                     </widget>
                                     <widget class="QWidget" name="page_30">
                                      <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_55">
                                       <property name="leftMargin">
                                        <number>0</number>
                                       </property>
                                       <property name="rightMargin">
                                        <number>0</number>
                                       </property>
                                       <item row="0" column="0">
                                        <widget class="QLabel" name="labelInputIonexDCBFile">
                                         <property name="toolTip">
                                          <string>&lt;b&gt;IONEX File:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Specify a IONEX file to obtain the DCB correction. Only version 1.00 contains DCB data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;IONEX files can be found in the links provided in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Other Files&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; To process multiple days in a single run, IONEX files from multiple days must be concatenated (in chronological order) with or without header (recommended with header). To concatenate files, use the following command line instruction:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Linux/Mac/Cygwin terminal:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;cat file1 file2 file3 ... file N &gt; &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Windows terminal:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;copy /b file1+file2+...+fileN &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;File1, file2, etc, are the input files to be concatenated. &lt;i&gt;Concatenated_file&lt;/i&gt; is the resulting file after concatenating all input files into one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Note that gLAB does not care about filename or extensions (as gLAB will check that the file contents matches the expected one), so any filename or extension can be used for the concatenated file.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                         </property>
                                         <property name="styleSheet">
                                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                         </property>
                                         <property name="text">
                                          <string>IONEX File:</string>
                                         </property>
                                        </widget>
                                       </item>
                                       <item row="0" column="1">
                                        <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditDcbSourceIonex">
                                         <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
