                                   <item row="0" column="0">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="labelInputSigmaMultipathFile">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;Sigma Multipath File:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Text file for setting a  a user defined model for sigma multipath model for a SBAS 1F receiver, which can be elevation or SNR dependent. This model consists of a set of elevation or SNR samples with its corresponding sigma values. With this set, gLAB will linearly interpolate the sigma value from the closest samples to the current value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; For details on how to generate a user defined sigma multipath file, read the manual entry available in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;User manuals-&gt;User Sigma Multipath File Manual.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
