                             <string>&lt;b&gt;GLONASS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the priority order for GLONASS navigation message selection. The selected navigation messages will be used for computing orbits and clocks. See &lt;i&gt;Preferred age time&lt;/i&gt; below for details on the navigation message selection algorithm.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The navigation message type supported for GLONASS is:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;FDMA:&lt;/b&gt; Navigation message sent in the FDMA (Frequency Division Multiple Access) signals (G1 and G2). This navigation message has no associated name.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
