                             <string>&lt;b&gt;IRNSS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the priority order for IRNSS navigation message selection. The selected navigation messages will be used for computing orbits and clocks. See &lt;i&gt;Preferred age time&lt;/i&gt; below for details on the navigation message selection algorithm.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The navigation message type supported for IRNSS is:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;CNAV:&lt;/b&gt; Civil navigation message sent in the L5 signal.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                            </property>
                            <property name="styleSheet">
                             <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
