                       <item row="3" column="0">
                        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_73">
                         <property name="toolTip">
                          <string>&lt;b&gt;GEO Selection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Select the initial SBAS GEO for reading SBAS corrections.&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;First Read:&lt;/b&gt; Select the first GEO read in the SBAS data file. This is the default.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;All Mixed:&lt;/b&gt;  Data from all GEOs will be all mixed together, as if all messages from all GEOs in the data file were sent from a unique GEO. This unique GEO has a PRN '0' inside gLAB.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Highest Elevation:&lt;/b&gt; Use the GEO with highest elevation. With this option, gLAB will not be able to select any GEO until almanacs (message type 17) or navigation messages (message type 9) with data from all available GEO are received.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Select PRN:&lt;/b&gt; Manually select a GEO by its PRN.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTES:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;GEO used for processing may change if GEO switching is enabled.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If &lt;i&gt;All Mixed&lt;/i&gt; option is selected, gLAB will also be able to switch to single GEO data if an alarm is received (from any GEO) and GEO switching is enabled.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If &lt;i&gt;Highest Elevation&lt;/i&gt; option is selected and receiver a priori position is set to be computed, in the first epoch gLAB will select a temporary GEO (the one with highest elevation in the initial position) until the solution converges (defined as the difference between the current and previous position computed being less than 100 metres), and in the following epoch the GEO with highest elevation in the converged position will be selected.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="styleSheet">
                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="text">
                          <string>GEO Selection</string>
                         </property>
                        </widget>
                       </item>
