                              </item>
                              <item row="1" column="3">
                               <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditDoNotUseForSafetyAppNPA_DFMC">
                                <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                 <bool>true</bool>
                                </property>
                               </widget>
                              </item>
                              <item row="3" column="0">
                               <widget class="QLabel" name="label_152">
                                <property name="toolTip">
                                 <string>&lt;b&gt;Clock Ephemeris Corrections and Covariance Matrix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Message type 32 is sent for each monitored satellite, and each message contains information only for one satellite. This message contains the orbit and clock corrections related to a specific navigation message, identified by the IODN (Issue Of Data Navigation), matching in each constellation:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;GPS:&lt;/b&gt; IODN matches the L1 LNAV broadcast IODC (Issue Of Data Clock).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Galileo:&lt;/b&gt; IODN matches the E5a F/NAV IOD&lt;sub&gt;nav&lt;/sub&gt; (Issue Of Data Navigation).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;SBAS:&lt;/b&gt; IODN matches the E1 CNAV IODG (Issue Of Data GEO).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Message type 32 also contains the DFREI (Dual Frequency Range Error Indicator), the parameters to compute the clock-ephemeris covariance matrix and the &amp;delta;R&lt;sub&gt;CORR&lt;/sub&gt; multiplier (to be used with R&lt;sub&gt;CORR&lt;/sub&gt; parameter in message type 37 -&lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;- for sigma degradation computation).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; The SBAS satellite sending the corrections, if it is providing a ranging service, it will send messages type 39/40 (&lt;i&gt;SBAS Satellite Ephemeris Corrections and Covariance Matrix&lt;/i&gt;) instead of message type 32 for its ephemeris and covariance matrix parameters.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="styleSheet">
                                 <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="text">
                                 <string>Clock Ephemeris
Corrections and
Covariance Matrix</string>
                                </property>
                               </widget>
                              </item>
                              <item row="1" column="2">
                               <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditDoNotUseForSafetyAppPA_DFMC">
                                <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                 <bool>true</bool>
                                </property>
                               </widget>
                              </item>
                              <item row="4" column="4">
                               <widget class="QLabel" name="label_155">
                                <property name="styleSheet">
                                 <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
