                                   <item row="5" column="2">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_513">
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>(m)</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="3" column="2">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_469">
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>(m)</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="3" column="4">
                                    <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditSetValueDFREI11">
                                     <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                      <bool>true</bool>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="2" column="1">
                                    <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditSetValueDFREI2">
                                     <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                      <bool>true</bool>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="5" column="4">
                                    <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditSetValueDFREI13">
                                     <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                      <bool>true</bool>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="1" column="3">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_505">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;DFREI=9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the conversion value to metres for DFREI (Dual Frequency Range Error Indicator) equal to 9, ignoring the conversion formula defined in MT37 (explained below).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When DFREI conversion value is read from MT37 (&lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;), the conversion to metres is done with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=9&lt;/sub&gt; · Scale_factor + Min_Range (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=9&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Conversion value read from MT37 DFREI table when DFREI=9.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scale_factor:&lt;/b&gt; Scale factor set in ED-259. For DFREI=9, the scale factor is 0.25 (metres)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Min_Range:&lt;/b&gt; Minimum value set in ED-259. For DFREI=9, the minimum value is 1.75 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;To get the default value set in this option, &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=9&lt;/sub&gt;=8 is used (&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI&lt;/sub&gt; size is 4 bit, therefore 8 is the intermidiate value between 0 and 15). Applying the formula above:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = 8 ·  0.25 + 1.75 = 3.75 (metres)&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>DFREI=9:</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="1" column="0">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_493">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;DFREI=1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the conversion value to metres for DFREI (Dual Frequency Range Error Indicator) equal to 1, ignoring the conversion formula defined in MT37 (explained below).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When DFREI conversion value is read from MT37 (&lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;), the conversion to metres is done with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=1&lt;/sub&gt; · Scale_factor + Min_Range (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=1&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Conversion value read from MT37 DFREI table when DFREI=1.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scale_factor:&lt;/b&gt; Scale factor set in ED-259. For DFREI=1, the scale factor is 0.125 (metres)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Min_Range:&lt;/b&gt; Minimum value set in ED-259. For DFREI=1, the minimum value is 0.25 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;To get the default value set in this option, &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=1&lt;/sub&gt;=8 is used (&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI&lt;/sub&gt; size is 4 bit, therefore 8 is the intermidiate value between 0 and 15). Applying the formula above:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = 8 ·  0.125 + 0.25 = 0.625 (metres)&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>DFREI=1:</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="7" column="2">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_515">
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>(m)</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="1" column="4">
                                    <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditSetValueDFREI9">
                                     <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                      <bool>true</bool>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="2" column="4">
                                    <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditSetValueDFREI10">
                                     <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                      <bool>true</bool>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="4" column="0">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_496">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;DFREI=4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the conversion value to metres for DFREI (Dual Frequency Range Error Indicator) equal to 4, ignoring the conversion formula defined in MT37 (explained below).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When DFREI conversion value is read from MT37 (&lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;), the conversion to metres is done with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=4&lt;/sub&gt; · Scale_factor + Min_Range (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=4&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Conversion value read from MT37 DFREI table when DFREI=4.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scale_factor:&lt;/b&gt; Scale factor set in ED-259. For DFREI=4, the scale factor is 0.125 (metres)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Min_Range:&lt;/b&gt; Minimum value set in ED-259. For DFREI=4, the minimum value is 0.625 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;To get the default value set in this option, &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=4&lt;/sub&gt;=8 is used (&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI&lt;/sub&gt; size is 4 bit, therefore 8 is the intermidiate value between 0 and 15). Applying the formula above:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = 8 ·  0.125 + 0.625 = 1.625 (metres)&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>DFREI=4:</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
