                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_511">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;DFREI=0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the conversion value to metres for DFREI (Dual Frequency Range Error Indicator) equal to 0, ignoring the conversion formula defined in MT37 (explained below).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When DFREI conversion value is read from MT37 (&lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;), the conversion to metres is done with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=0&lt;/sub&gt; · Scale_factor + Min_Range (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=0&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Conversion value read from MT37 DFREI table when DFREI=0.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scale_factor:&lt;/b&gt; Scale factor set in ED-259. For DFREI=0, the scale factor is 0.0625 (metres)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Min_Range:&lt;/b&gt; Minimum value set in ED-259. For DFREI=0, the minimum value is 0.125 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;To get the default value set in this option, &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=0&lt;/sub&gt;=8 is used (&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI&lt;/sub&gt; size is 4 bit, therefore 8 is the intermidiate value between 0 and 15). Applying the formula above:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = 8 ·  0.0625 + 0.125 = 0.625 (metres)&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>DFREI=0:</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="5" column="0">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_497">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;DFREI=5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the conversion value to metres for DFREI (Dual Frequency Range Error Indicator) equal to 5, ignoring the conversion formula defined in MT37 (explained below).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When DFREI conversion value is read from MT37 (&lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;), the conversion to metres is done with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=5&lt;/sub&gt; · Scale_factor + Min_Range (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=5&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Conversion value read from MT37 DFREI table when DFREI=5.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scale_factor:&lt;/b&gt; Scale factor set in ED-259. For DFREI=5, the scale factor is 0.25 (metres)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Min_Range:&lt;/b&gt; Minimum value set in ED-259. For DFREI=5, the minimum value is 0.75 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;To get the default value set in this option, &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=5&lt;/sub&gt;=8 is used (&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI&lt;/sub&gt; size is 4 bit, therefore 8 is the intermidiate value between 0 and 15). Applying the formula above:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = 8 ·  0.25 + 0.75 = 2.75 (metres)&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>DFREI=5:</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="2" column="3">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_506">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;DFREI=10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the conversion value to metres for DFREI (Dual Frequency Range Error Indicator) equal to 10, ignoring the conversion formula defined in MT37 (explained below).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When DFREI conversion value is read from MT37 (&lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;), the conversion to metres is done with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=10&lt;/sub&gt; · Scale_factor + Min_Range (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=10&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Conversion value read from MT37 DFREI table when DFREI=10.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scale_factor:&lt;/b&gt; Scale factor set in ED-259. For DFREI=10, the scale factor is 0.5 (metres)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Min_Range:&lt;/b&gt; Minimum value set in ED-259. For DFREI=10, the minimum value is 2 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;To get the default value set in this option, &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=10&lt;/sub&gt;=8 is used (&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI&lt;/sub&gt; size is 4 bit, therefore 8 is the intermidiate value between 0 and 15). Applying the formula above:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = 8 ·  0.5 + 2 = 6 (metres)&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>DFREI=10:</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="6" column="3">
                                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_510">
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;DFREI=14&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the conversion value to metres for DFREI (Dual Frequency Range Error Indicator) equal to 14, ignoring the conversion formula defined in MT37 (explained below).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When DFREI conversion value is read from MT37 (&lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;), the conversion to metres is done with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=14&lt;/sub&gt; · Scale_factor + Min_Range (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=14&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Conversion value read from MT37 DFREI table when DFREI=14.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scale_factor:&lt;/b&gt; Scale factor set in ED-259. For DFREI=14, the scale factor is 6 (metres)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Min_Range:&lt;/b&gt; Minimum value set in ED-259. For DFREI=14, the minimum value is 10 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;To get the default value set in this option, &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI=14&lt;/sub&gt;=8 is used (&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFREI&lt;/sub&gt; size is 4 bit, therefore 8 is the intermidiate value between 0 and 15). Applying the formula above:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;DFRE&lt;/sub&gt; = 8 ·  6 + 10 = 58 (metres)&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>DFREI=14:</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="3" column="1">
                                    <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditSetValueDFREI3">
                                     <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                                      <bool>true</bool>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
