                                   <item row="2" column="0">
                                    <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxSetRcorrOBADParameterMT37">
                                     <property name="minimumSize">
                                      <size>
                                       <width>0</width>
                                       <height>25</height>
                                      </size>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;Set Rcorr OBAD Parameter from MT 37&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Message type 37 sends OBAD (Old But Active Data) parameters for computing degradation parameters (as described in &lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;). R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; is a constellation based parameter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With this parameter, R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; set by user (in metres/second) will be used instead of reading it from MT37.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; is used for computing &amp;epsilon;&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;epsilon;&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; = int( (t - t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;) / I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; ) ·  C&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; + (t - t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;) · R&lt;sub&gt;corr_sv&lt;/sub&gt;/1000 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;t:&lt;/b&gt; Current time (seconds)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Time of applicability (in seconds) of the last received MT32 (or MT39/40 if it is the SBAS satellite sending the corrections).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;C&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; OBAD parameter sent in message type 37 applicable for current constellation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;R&lt;sub&gt;corr_sv&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Parameter computed with the following formula:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If (t - t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;) &amp;le; I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;R&lt;sub&gt;corr_sv&lt;/sub&gt; = R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; · &amp;delta;R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; (mm/s)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If (t - t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;) &amp;gt; I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;R&lt;sub&gt;corr_sv&lt;/sub&gt; = R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; (mm/s)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt; R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;  OBAD parameter sent in message type 37 applicable for current constellation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;delta;R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; scale factor sent in message type 32 or 39/40 (different per each satellite).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt; As R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; is a constellation based parameter, it can be provided as a unique value for all constellations or in a per constellation basis through the &lt;i&gt;Advanced&lt;/i&gt; button on the right.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>Set Rcorr OBAD Parameter from MT 37</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
                                   </item>
                                   <item row="0" column="0">
                                    <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxSetIcorrOBADParameterMT37">
                                     <property name="minimumSize">
                                      <size>
                                       <width>0</width>
                                       <height>25</height>
                                      </size>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="toolTip">
                                      <string>&lt;b&gt;Set Icorr OBAD Parameter from MT 37&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Message type 37 sends OBAD (Old But Active Data) parameters for computing degradation parameters (as described in &lt;i&gt;OBAD Parameters and DFREI Scale Table&lt;/i&gt;). I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; is a constellation based parameter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With this parameter, I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; set by user (in seconds) will be used instead of reading it from MT37.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; is used for computing &amp;epsilon;&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;epsilon;&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; = int( (t - t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;) / I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; ) ·  C&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; + (t - t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;) · R&lt;sub&gt;corr_sv&lt;/sub&gt;/1000 (metres)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;t:&lt;/b&gt; Current time (seconds)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Time of applicability (in seconds) of the last received MT32 (or MT39/40 if it is the SBAS satellite sending the corrections).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;C&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; OBAD parameter sent in message type 37 applicable for current constellation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;R&lt;sub&gt;corr_sv&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Parameter computed with the following formula:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If (t - t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;) &amp;le; I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;R&lt;sub&gt;corr_sv&lt;/sub&gt; = R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; · &amp;delta;R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; (mm/s)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If (t - t&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;) &amp;gt; I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;R&lt;sub&gt;corr_sv&lt;/sub&gt; = R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; (mm/s)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt; R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;  OBAD parameter sent in message type 37 applicable for current constellation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;delta;R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; R&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; scale factor sent in message type 32 or 39/40 (different per each satellite).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt; As I&lt;sub&gt;corr&lt;/sub&gt; is a constellation based parameter, it can be provided as a unique value for all constellations or in a per constellation basis through the &lt;i&gt;Advanced&lt;/i&gt; button on the right.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="styleSheet">
                                      <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                     </property>
                                     <property name="text">
                                      <string>Set Icorr OBAD Parameter from MT 37</string>
                                     </property>
                                    </widget>
