                    <item row="6" column="0">
                     <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxDgnssOptions">
                      <property name="sizePolicy">
                       <sizepolicy hsizetype="Preferred" vsizetype="Fixed">
                        <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                        <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                       </sizepolicy>
                      </property>
                      <property name="font">
                       <font>
                        <pointsize>9</pointsize>
                        <weight>75</weight>
                        <bold>true</bold>
                       </font>
                      </property>
                      <property name="styleSheet">
                       <string notr="true">QGroupBox {color: rgb(45, 36, 90);}</string>
                      </property>
                      <property name="title">
                       <string>DGNSS Options</string>
                      </property>
                      <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_89">
                       <property name="leftMargin">
                        <number>6</number>
                       </property>
                       <property name="topMargin">
                        <number>9</number>
                       </property>
                       <property name="rightMargin">
                        <number>6</number>
                       </property>
                       <property name="bottomMargin">
                        <number>6</number>
                       </property>
                       <property name="verticalSpacing">
                        <number>3</number>
                       </property>
                       <item row="1" column="0">
                        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_76">
                         <property name="toolTip">
                          <string>&lt;b&gt;Maximum Age for Corrections&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the maximum lifetime for the DGNSS corrections. As corrections get &lt;i&gt;old&lt;/i&gt; (time passes since the correction is received or computed), a degradation term will be added to these corrections until they reach the maximum age and get discarded or are replaced by new corrections.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="styleSheet">
                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="text">
                          <string>Maximum Age for Corrections</string>
                         </property>
                        </widget>
                       </item>
                       <item row="1" column="1">
                        <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditMaxAgeDgnss">
                         <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                          <bool>true</bool>
                         </property>
                        </widget>
                       </item>
                       <item row="0" column="0">
                        <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxDgnssInflateSigma">
                         <property name="toolTip">
                          <string>&lt;b&gt;Inflate Sigma During the Smoothing Convergence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If this option is enabled, during the satellite smoothing convergence, the satellite sigma is inflated with the following formula:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;inflated&lt;/sub&gt; = f(n)/N&lt;sub&gt;steady&lt;/sub&gt; · &amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;satellite&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;n&amp;lt;N   f(n) =  &amp;radic;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: overline&quot;&gt;1/n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;n&amp;ge;N   f(n) =  &amp;radic;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: overline&quot;&gt;1/(2N-1) · (1+((N-1)/N)&lt;sup&gt;2·(n-N)+1&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;n:&lt;/b&gt; Number of processed samples.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;N:&lt;/b&gt; Number of samples of the smoothing window.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nsteady:&lt;/b&gt; Number of samples when reaching the steady state: In gLAB, Nstdy = tointeger(3.6*N)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;sigma;&lt;sub&gt;satellite&lt;/sub&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; The computed sigma for the satellite. See &lt;i&gt;StdDev from DGNSS&lt;/i&gt; in the FILTER section for details on how to compute the sigma in DGNSS.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;For instance, with 1 second sampling rate and N=100, the stationary state (Nstdy) is assumed to be reached after 360 seconds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; The term 'f(n)/N&lt;sub&gt;steady&lt;/sub&gt;' is the inflation factor for the satellite sigma. It is adimensional, and it may be referred as K&lt;sub&gt;inf&lt;/sub&gt;.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="styleSheet">
                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="text">
                          <string>Inflate Sigma During the Smoothing Convergence</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="checked">
                          <bool>true</bool>
                         </property>
                        </widget>
                       </item>
                       <item row="1" column="2">
                        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_186">
                         <property name="styleSheet">
                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="text">
                          <string>(s)</string>
                         </property>
                        </widget>
                       </item>
                       <item row="2" column="0">
                        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_296">
                         <property name="toolTip">
                          <string>&lt;b&gt;Maximum value for DGNSS corrections)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When computing DGNSS corrections from a RTCM v3 or RINEX file, if a correction for a satellite is higher than this threshold, it will be automatically discarded /typically corrections are of few metres).&lt;br&gt;This limit is particularly useful if the user makes a reference station change, as from one epoch to another the reference station will change, but the message with the new reference station coordinates will take some seconds to arrive, making the computed corrections during this interval totally incorrect (as corrections from the new station will be computed using the coordinates from the previous reference station):&lt;br&gt;</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="styleSheet">
                          <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                         </property>
                         <property name="text">
                          <string>Maximum value for DGNSS corrections</string>
                         </property>
                        </widget>
                       </item>
                       <item row="2" column="1">
                        <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditMaxValueDGNSS">
                         <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                          <bool>true</bool>
                         </property>
                        </widget>
                       </item>
