                                           <string>&lt;b&gt;Phase:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the carrier phase measurement for the first Galileo graphical combination (GC) in the filter. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; If it is set to &lt;i&gt;Auto&lt;/i&gt;, gLAB will automatically select them according to the measurement order (see option &lt;i&gt;Set GNSS Frequencies and Measurements Order&lt;/i&gt; above) and the available ones in the RINEX observation file.&lt;br&gt;</string>
