                                                 <string>&lt;b&gt;Freq2:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the second frequency (for ionospheric-free or divergence-free combinations) for smoothing the third IRNSS code measurement.&lt;br&gt;</string>
