                              <item row="0" column="0">
                               <widget class="QRadioButton" name="radioButtonStatic">
                                <property name="minimumSize">
                                 <size>
                                  <width>73</width>
                                  <height>0</height>
                                 </size>
                                </property>
                                <property name="maximumSize">
                                 <size>
                                  <width>73</width>
                                  <height>16777215</height>
                                 </size>
                                </property>
                                <property name="font">
                                 <font>
                                  <weight>50</weight>
                                  <bold>false</bold>
                                 </font>
                                </property>
                                <property name="toolTip">
                                 <string>&lt;b&gt;Static receiver&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Select this option to perform a processing supposing that the receiver is static. This modifies the filter parameters &lt;b&gt;Phi&lt;/b&gt; (propagation) and &lt;b&gt;Q&lt;/b&gt; (process noise) for the coordinates estimation to:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Phi = 1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Q = 0  m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="styleSheet">
                                 <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="text">
                                 <string>Static</string>
                                </property>
                               </widget>
                              </item>
                              <item row="0" column="1">
                               <widget class="QRadioButton" name="radioButtonKinematic">
                                <property name="minimumSize">
                                 <size>
                                  <width>93</width>
                                  <height>0</height>
                                 </size>
                                </property>
                                <property name="maximumSize">
                                 <size>
                                  <width>93</width>
                                  <height>16777215</height>
                                 </size>
                                </property>
                                <property name="font">
                                 <font>
                                  <weight>50</weight>
                                  <bold>false</bold>
                                 </font>
                                </property>
                                <property name="toolTip">
                                 <string>&lt;b&gt;Kinematic receiver&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Select this option to perform a processing supposing that the receiver is in movement. This modifies the filter parameters &lt;b&gt;Phi&lt;/b&gt; (propagation) and &lt;b&gt;Q&lt;/b&gt; (process noise) for the coordinates estimation to:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Phi = 0&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Q = 1·10&lt;sup&gt;8&lt;/sup&gt;  m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTES:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Receiver Coordinates Q = Po = 1·10&lt;sup&gt;8&lt;/sup&gt; correspond to (10 km)&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Setting the coordinates to &lt;i&gt;Kinematic&lt;/i&gt; behaviour makes the Kalman filter to behave as a Weighted Least Square (WLS) algorithm (in coordinate estimation).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="styleSheet">
                                 <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="text">
                                 <string>Kinematic</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="checked">
                                 <bool>true</bool>
                                </property>
                               </widget>
                              </item>
                              <item row="0" column="2">
                               <widget class="QRadioButton" name="radioButtonRandomwalkCoordinates">
                                <property name="minimumSize">
                                 <size>
                                  <width>105</width>
                                  <height>0</height>
                                 </size>
                                </property>
                                <property name="maximumSize">
                                 <size>
                                  <width>105</width>
                                  <height>16777215</height>
                                 </size>
                                </property>
                                <property name="toolTip">
                                 <string>&lt;b&gt;Random Walk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Select this option to perform a processing supposing that the receiver is in small movement, so the filter can keep some coordinate correlation between epochs. In order for random walk to make a difference with respect to kinematic positioning, the movement rate (set by process noise) must be small.&lt;br&gt;This modifies the filter parameters &lt;b&gt;Phi&lt;/b&gt; (propagation) and &lt;b&gt;Q&lt;/b&gt; (process noise) for the coordinates estimation to:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Phi = 1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Q = 70 m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;/s&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; Units for process noise (&lt;b&gt;Q&lt;/b&gt;) are changed from m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; to m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;/s in order to be dependent on time.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="styleSheet">
                                 <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="text">
                                 <string>Random Walk</string>
                                </property>
                               </widget>
                              </item>
                             </layout>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
