                           <item row="1" column="0">
                            <widget class="QLabel" name="label_77">
                             <property name="minimumSize">
                              <size>
                               <width>145</width>
                               <height>0</height>
                              </size>
                             </property>
                             <property name="maximumSize">
                              <size>
                               <width>145</width>
                               <height>16777215</height>
                              </size>
                             </property>
                             <property name="font">
                              <font>
                               <weight>50</weight>
                               <bold>false</bold>
                              </font>
                             </property>
                             <property name="toolTip">
                              <string>&lt;b&gt;Receiver coordinates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This comprises the 3 parameters with the 3D position [XYZ] of the receiver. Typical values:&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;A priori value:&lt;/b&gt; A priori receiver position, configured in &lt;i&gt;Input&lt;/i&gt; section&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phi: &lt;/b&gt; '1' [Static positioning], '0' [Kinematic positioning], '70' [Random walk positioning]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process noise (Q):&lt;/b&gt; '0' [Static positioning], 1·10&lt;sup&gt;8&lt;/sup&gt; [Kinematic positioning], '9' [Random walk positioning]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Initial covariance (Po): &lt;/b&gt; 1·10&lt;sup&gt;8&lt;/sup&gt; (A smaller value for the initial covariance will increase the convergence time, but requires a good initial position)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; Receiver Coordinates Q = Po = 1·10&lt;sup&gt;8&lt;/sup&gt; correspond to (10 km)&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;br&gt;</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="styleSheet">
                              <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="text">
                              <string>Coordinates</string>
                             </property>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
                           <item row="1" column="4">
                            <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditPoCoordinates">
                             <property name="maximumSize">
                              <size>
                               <width>75</width>
                               <height>16777215</height>
                              </size>
                             </property>
                             <property name="font">
                              <font>
                               <weight>50</weight>
                               <bold>false</bold>
                              </font>
                             </property>
                             <property name="clearButtonEnabled">
                              <bool>true</bool>
                             </property>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
                           <item row="0" column="4">
                            <widget class="QLabel" name="label_81">
                             <property name="font">
                              <font>
                               <weight>50</weight>
                               <bold>false</bold>
                              </font>
                             </property>
                             <property name="toolTip">
                              <string>&lt;b&gt;Initial covariance (P0)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Kalman filter requires initial values for all its parameters: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Position:&lt;/b&gt; 1·10&lt;sup&gt;8&lt;/sup&gt; (m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;) value is assigned due to the unknown difference between the initial a priori value and the real position.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Clock:&lt;/b&gt; A 9·10&lt;sup&gt;10&lt;/sup&gt; (m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;) value is assigned due to its high variability.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inter-System Clock Bias:&lt;/b&gt; A 9·10&lt;sup&gt;10&lt;/sup&gt; (m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;) value is assigned due to its unknown value.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Troposphere:&lt;/b&gt; Due to the fact that about 90% of the troposphere is corrected by a proper modelling, and only a 10% has to be estimated (and is usually no higher than about 10 cm), a 0.25 (m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;) value is used for a priori.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Carrier phase ambiguities:&lt;/b&gt; As carrier phase is prealigned with code, the value 400 (m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;) is used as a priori.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;The parameter &lt;b&gt;P0&lt;/b&gt; sets the initial uncertainty of these a priori values.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="styleSheet">
                              <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="text">
                              <string>Po</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="alignment">
                              <set>Qt::AlignCenter</set>
                             </property>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
                           <item row="2" column="1">
                            <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditPhiClock">
                             <property name="maximumSize">
                              <size>
                               <width>75</width>
