                           <item row="3" column="0">
                            <widget class="QLabel" name="label_436">
                             <property name="minimumSize">
                              <size>
                               <width>145</width>
                               <height>0</height>
                              </size>
                             </property>
                             <property name="maximumSize">
                              <size>
                               <width>145</width>
                               <height>16777215</height>
                              </size>
                             </property>
                             <property name="toolTip">
                              <string>&lt;b&gt;Inter-System Clock Bias&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This parameter is the offset between the receiver clock (which will be aligned to one constellation) and the reference clock for the other constellations (there will be an inter-system clock bias unknown for each constellation different from the reference one) . Typical values:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;A priori value:&lt;/b&gt; '0'&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phi:&lt;/b&gt; '0'&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process noise (Q): &lt;/b&gt; '0' [Constant],  9·10&lt;sup&gt;10&lt;/sup&gt; m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; or 1·10&lt;sup&gt;12&lt;/sup&gt; ns&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; [White noise], 9  m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;/day or 9 ns&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;/day [Random walk]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Initial covariance (Po): &lt;/b&gt;9·10&lt;sup&gt;10&lt;/sup&gt; m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; or 1·10&lt;sup&gt;12&lt;/sup&gt; ns&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; Inter-System Clock Bias Q = Po = 9·10&lt;sup&gt;10&lt;/sup&gt; correspond to (1 msec)&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;br&gt;</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="styleSheet">
                              <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="text">
                              <string>Inter-System Clock Bias</string>
                             </property>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
