                             <item row="0" column="0">
                              <widget class="QLabel" name="label_245">
                               <property name="toolTip">
                                <string>&lt;b&gt;Constellation Letter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In SP3 files, the list of satellites in the file is given in the header. As the data written is the receiver solution but it has to follow the SP3 standard, at least one satellite has to be set (which in this case will correspond to the receiver solution).&lt;br&gt;With this option, the constellation letter of the satellite in the SP3 is set. By default is 'L', which stands for &quot;LEO&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; If gLAB reads an unknown constellation letter (such as 'L') in SP3 files,  it will manage it as a GPS satellite.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                               </property>
                               <property name="styleSheet">
                                <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                               </property>
                               <property name="text">
                                <string>Constellation Letter:</string>
                               </property>
                              </widget>
                             </item>
                             <item row="0" column="2">
                              <widget class="QLabel" name="label_246">
                               <property name="toolTip">
                                <string>&lt;b&gt;PRN Number&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In SP3 files, the list of satellites in the file is given in the header. As the data written is the receiver solution but it has to follow the SP3 standard, at least one satellite has to be set (which in this case will correspond to the receiver solution).&lt;br&gt;With this option, the PRN number of the satellite in the SP3 is set. By default is '9'.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                               </property>
                               <property name="styleSheet">
                                <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                               </property>
                               <property name="text">
