                           <item row="6" column="0">
                            <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxPrintSatpvt">
                             <property name="toolTip">
                              <string>&lt;b&gt;SATPVT messages (show product mode)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Satellite data messages for show product mode. This message show the PVT data for a specific time and satellite.&lt;br/&gt; Messages will be sorted by constellation and PRN, with this constellation order: GPS, Galileo, GLONASS, GEO, BeiDou, QZSS, IRNSS. All time tags are in GPS time.&lt;br/&gt; Coordinates are in WGS84 system except for Galileo and BeiDou with broadcast orbits, which are in GTRF and CGCS2000 systems respectively.&lt;br/&gt; GTRF and CGCS2000 systems are aligned to WGS84 to a few centimetres, therefore, it is assumed that GTRF=WGS84 and CGCS2000=WGS84.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 1:&lt;/b&gt; 'SATPVT'&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 2:&lt;/b&gt; Year&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 3:&lt;/b&gt; DoY&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 4:&lt;/b&gt; Seconds of day&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 5:&lt;/b&gt; Time in HH:MM:SS.zz format&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 6:&lt;/b&gt; GNSS System&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 7:&lt;/b&gt; PRN satellite identifier&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 8:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite block type&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 9:&lt;/b&gt; SVN (Space Vehicle Number)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 10:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite elevation [degrees]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 11:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite azimuth [degrees]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 12:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite X position [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 13:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite Y position [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 14:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite Z position [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 15:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite X velocity [m/s]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 16:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite Y velocity [m/s]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 17:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite Z velocity [m/s]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 18:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite latitude [degrees]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 19:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite longitude [degrees]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 20:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite height [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 21:&lt;/b&gt; Satellite clock offset [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 22:&lt;/b&gt; Ephemerides block type name (LNAV, CNAV, etc.) or 'SP3' if precise products are used&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 23:&lt;/b&gt; IOD number or '-1' if no IOD in broadcast message or precise products are used&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 24:&lt;/b&gt; Health letter (H=Healthy, M=Marginal, U=Unhealthy), health value. If unhealthy, health flags are shown by frequency.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fields 10 and 11 will only be non zero if a user defined position is set with parameter '-pre:setrecpos'.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sample:&lt;/b&gt; SATPVT 2019 182 64830.00 18:00:30.00 GPS  4 UNKNOWN_BLOCK     -1   24.452 -146.772  15726758.8543 -11721444.2647 -17893256.4825      2263.5069       284.8536      1801.6815  -42.418676449  -36.697844087  20181374.7732      50617.846188      LNAV    2 U-63_(L1-U_L2-U)&lt;br&gt;</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="styleSheet">
                              <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="text">
                              <string>Print SATPVT</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="checked">
                              <bool>true</bool>
                             </property>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
                           <item row="1" column="0">
                            <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxPrintSatstat">
                             <property name="toolTip">
                              <string>&lt;b&gt;SATSTAT messages (orbit and clock comparison)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Satellite difference summary message for products comparison mode. This message shows the differences between orbit and clocks for two different OC products fonts for a specific satellite. It is shown after all the comparisons are done, and presents a summary for each satellite.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 1:&lt;/b&gt; 'SATSTAT'&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 2:&lt;/b&gt; GNSS System&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 3:&lt;/b&gt; PRN satellite identifier&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 4:&lt;/b&gt; Number of samples&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 5-7:&lt;/b&gt; SISRE comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 8-10:&lt;/b&gt; SISRE orbit-only comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 11-13:&lt;/b&gt; 3D orbit comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 14-16:&lt;/b&gt; Clock comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 17-19:&lt;/b&gt; DCB comparisons (mean [L1 m], RMS [L1 m], stdDev [L1 m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 20-22:&lt;/b&gt; Radial position comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 23-25:&lt;/b&gt; Along-track position comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 26-28:&lt;/b&gt; Cross-track position comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sample:&lt;/b&gt; SATSTAT  1   95     1.5530     2.1112     1.4302     0.9279     1.0058     0.3881     1.4115     1.4714     0.4155    -0.3357     1.9280     1.8985     0.8988     0.9938     0.4239     0.6081     0.9604     0.7433     0.1717     0.5050     0.4750&lt;br&gt;</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="styleSheet">
                              <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="text">
                              <string>Print SATSTAT</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="checked">
                              <bool>true</bool>
                             </property>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
                           <item row="3" column="0">
                            <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxPrintSatdiff">
                             <property name="toolTip">
                              <string>&lt;b&gt;SATDIFF messages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Satellite difference message for products comparison mode. This message shows the difference between both orbit and clocks for two different OC products fonts for a specific time. It is shown each time step, being all time tags in GPS time. The SISRE fields are the Signal-in-Space Range Error, it is a measure of how the error impact a general receiver found in the Earth's surface. It is computed as:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;SISRE = sqrt((radDiff-clkDiff)&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; + 1/49*(ctDiff&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; + atDiff&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;))&lt;br/&gt; Being:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;radDiff:&lt;/b&gt; The difference of satellite positions in the radial component&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;clkDiff:&lt;/b&gt; The difference of satellite clock offsets&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;ctDiff:&lt;/b&gt; The difference of satellite positions in the cross-track component&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;atDiff:&lt;/b&gt; The difference of satellite positions in the along-track component&lt;br&gt; Messages will be sorted by constellation and PRN, with this constellation order: GPS, Galileo, GLONASS, GEO, BeiDou, QZSS, IRNSS. All time tags are in GPS time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 1:&lt;/b&gt; 'SATDIFF'&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 2:&lt;/b&gt; Year&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 3:&lt;/b&gt; DoY&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 4:&lt;/b&gt; Seconds of day&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 5:&lt;/b&gt; Time of day&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 6:&lt;/b&gt; GNSS System&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 7:&lt;/b&gt; PRN satellite identifier&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 8:&lt;/b&gt; SISRE difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 9:&lt;/b&gt; SISRE orbit-only difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 10:&lt;/b&gt; 3D orbit difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 11:&lt;/b&gt; Clock difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 12:&lt;/b&gt; GPS P1-P2 DCB difference or QZSS C1C DCB difference. If not GPS or QZSS, this value is 0 [L1 m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 13:&lt;/b&gt; Radial position difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 14:&lt;/b&gt; Along-track position difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 15:&lt;/b&gt; Cross-track position difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 16:&lt;/b&gt; X position difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 17:&lt;/b&gt; Y position difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 18:&lt;/b&gt; Z position difference [m]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 19:&lt;/b&gt; Ephemerides block type name (LNAV, CNAV, etc.) or 'SP3' if precise products are used (separated by a dash '-')&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 20:&lt;/b&gt; IOD number or '-1' if no IOD in broadcast message or precise products are used for first source&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 21:&lt;/b&gt; IOD number or '-1' if no IOD in broadcast message or precise products are used for second source&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 22:&lt;/b&gt; Health letter (H=Healthy, M=Marginal, U=Unhealthy), health value. If unhealthy, health flags are shown by frequency for first source&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 23:&lt;/b&gt; Health letter (H=Healthy, M=Marginal, U=Unhealthy), health value. If unhealthy, health flags are shown by frequency for second source&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sample:&lt;/b&gt; SATDIFF 2018 026   300.00 00:05:00.00 GPS  1     0.3205     0.7588     1.0104    -0.4470    -0.7526     0.2982    -0.6046     0.3084     0.9177     0.2892      LNAV-SP3        73  -1 H-0&lt;br&gt;</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="styleSheet">
                              <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="text">
                              <string>Print SATDIFF</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="checked">
                              <bool>true</bool>
                             </property>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
                           <item row="0" column="0">
                            <widget class="QFrame" name="frame_16">
                             <property name="sizePolicy">
                              <sizepolicy hsizetype="Preferred" vsizetype="Fixed">
                               <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                               <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                              </sizepolicy>
                             </property>
                             <property name="frameShape">
                              <enum>QFrame::NoFrame</enum>
                             </property>
                             <property name="frameShadow">
                              <enum>QFrame::Raised</enum>
                             </property>
                             <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_112">
                              <property name="leftMargin">
                               <number>0</number>
                              </property>
                              <property name="topMargin">
                               <number>0</number>
                              </property>
                              <property name="rightMargin">
                               <number>0</number>
                              </property>
                              <property name="bottomMargin">
                               <number>0</number>
                              </property>
                              <item row="0" column="1">
                               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonOrbitsComparisonMessagesNone">
                                <property name="toolTip">
                                 <string>Unselect all output messages.</string>
                                </property>
                                <property name="text">
                                 <string>None</string>
                                </property>
                               </widget>
                              </item>
                              <item row="0" column="0">
                               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonOrbitsComparisonMessagesAll">
                                <property name="toolTip">
                                 <string>Select all output messages.</string>
