                               </widget>
                              </item>
                             </layout>
                            </widget>
                           </item>
                           <item row="2" column="0">
                            <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxPrintSatstattot">
                             <property name="toolTip">
                              <string>&lt;b&gt;SATSTATTOT messages (orbit and clock comparison)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Satellite difference summary message for products comparison mode. This message shows the differences between orbit and clocks for two different OC products fonts for a specific satellite. It is shown after all the comparisons are done, and presents a summary for each satellite.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 1:&lt;/b&gt; 'SATSTAT'&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 2:&lt;/b&gt; Number of samples&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 3-5:&lt;/b&gt; SISRE comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 6-8:&lt;/b&gt; SISRE orbit-only comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 9-11:&lt;/b&gt; 3D orbit comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 12-14:&lt;/b&gt; Clock comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 15-17:&lt;/b&gt; DCB comparisons (mean [L1 m], RMS [L1 m], stdDev [L1 m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 18-20:&lt;/b&gt; Radial position comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 21-23:&lt;/b&gt; Along-track position comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field 24-26:&lt;/b&gt; Cross-track position comparisons (mean [m], RMS [m], stdDev [m])&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sample:&lt;/b&gt; SATSTATTOT 2660     1.2971     1.6206     0.9714     1.0207     1.1478     0.5250     1.6623     1.7701     0.6083    -0.1909     1.3835     1.3702     0.9488     1.1312     0.6160     0.0514     1.1930     1.1918    -0.0345     0.6560     0.6551&lt;br&gt;</string>
                             </property>
                             <property name="styleSheet">
                              <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                             </property>
