                                <item row="2" column="0">
                                 <widget class="QLabel" name="label_557">
                                  <property name="toolTip">
                                   <string>&lt;b&gt;Time Period Thresholds (Hor/Ver/3D)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the Horizontal, Vertical and 3D formal error time period thresholds (in seconds) to compute the convergence time using formal errors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Convergence time will be computed with two methodologies:&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Convergence is declared in the first epoch where the formal error value is equal or below the threshold set in option &lt;i&gt;Formal Error Thresholds (Hor/Ver/3D)&lt;/i&gt; (even though in later epochs the formal error increases again over the threshold). &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Convergence is declared when the formal error is equal or below the threshold  set in option &lt;i&gt;Formal Error Thresholds (Hor/Ver/3D)&lt;/i&gt; and it is maintained during the user defined amount of time set in option &lt;i&gt;Time Period Thresholds (Hor/Ver/3D)&lt;/i&gt;. If the formal error is equal or below the threshold during the specified time, the convergence time is referred to the first epoch (of this period) with formal error equal or below the threshold. Otherwise, if the formal error goes over the threshold, the time period is reset and will start again on the next epoch with formal error equal or below the threshold.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTES:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The formal error refers to the Kalman filter sigmas for the XYZ components (which are converted to NEU).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;As formal errors are internally computed by the Kalman filter, these can be computed even if there is no reference position available (as no reference position is used for formal error computation).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each component is evaluated independently from each other.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Convergence time computed using formal errors is independent from the convergence time computed using positioning errors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                                  </property>
                                  <property name="styleSheet">
                                   <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                                  </property>
                                  <property name="text">
                                   <string>Time Period Thresholds (Hor/Ver/3D)</string>
                                  </property>
                                 </widget>
                                </item>
