                             <string>&lt;b&gt;Auto&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Measurements printed in the MEAS will be set automatically. The default setting is to print, in a per constellation basis, all the mesurements available (except Doppler) in the header of the RINEX observation file.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; Pseudoranges and carrier phases will always be printed by default in pairs, that is, when a measurement of either type is found but not its counterpart, both will be printed, with the missing measurement value set to zero.&lt;br&gt;</string>
