                        <property name="toolTip">
                         <string>&lt;b&gt;Style selection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Allows to change the style of the plot marker: &lt;i&gt;Lines&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;Dots&lt;/i&gt; markers are available together with some others.&lt;br&gt;</string>
