                      <widget class="QComboBox" name="comboBoxConverterDgnssInput">
                       <property name="focusPolicy">
                        <enum>Qt::StrongFocus</enum>
                       </property>
                       <property name="toolTip">
                        <string>&lt;b&gt;DGNSS reference station file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Selects the input reference station file. Supported formats are:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;RINEX observation file:&lt;/b&gt; A RINEX observation file from a fixed station with known coordinates.&lt;br&gt;RINEX Observation files can be found in the links provided in the following menus:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;RINEX Observation Files&lt;br&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;RINEX files from Institutions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;RTCM Auto:&lt;/b&gt; In this mode gLAB will autodetect if RTCM file is version 2.x or 3.x.&lt;br&gt;RTCM files have to be downloaded from a Ntrip  (Network Transport of RTCM via Internet Protocol) server. See NTRIP server list in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Lists of NTRIP servers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;RTCM 2.x:&lt;/b&gt; RTCM version 2. In this mode, the initial date and hour of the data has to be provided, as this information is not in the binary file.&lt;br&gt;RTCM files have to be downloaded from a Ntrip (Network Transport of RTCM via Internet Protocol) server. See NTRIP server list in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Lists of NTRIP servers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;RTCM v3.x:&lt;/b&gt; RTCM version 3. In this mode, the initial date of the data has to be provided, as this information is not in the binary file.&lt;br&gt;RTCM files have to be downloaded from a Ntrip (Network Transport of RTCM via Internet Protocol) server. See NTRIP server list in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;Lists of NTRIP servers&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                       </property>
                       <item>
                        <property name="text">
                         <string>RTCM Auto:</string>
                        </property>
                       </item>
                       <item>
                        <property name="text">
                         <string>RTCM v2.x:</string>
                        </property>
                       </item>
                       <item>
                        <property name="text">
                         <string>RTCM v3.x:</string>
                        </property>
                       </item>
