                    <property name="toolTip">
                     <string>&lt;b&gt;SBAS messages file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Selects the SBAS processing mode (1F -single frequency SBAS- and SBAS DFMC. Supported file formats are RINEX-B 2.11, EMS 2.0 or Multi-Band EMS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SBAS message files may have data for multiple GEOs or from both SBAS 1F and SBAS DFMC or multiple GEOs and  both SBAS 1F and SBAS DFMC. gLAB will convert the data from both SBAS 1F and SBAS DFMC on  the same execution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SBAS files can be found in the links provided in the following menu:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;Help-&gt;Download data files-&gt;SBAS Files&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="styleSheet">
                     <string notr="true">color: rgb(0, 0, 0);</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>SBAS File (RINEX-B or EMS):</string>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
