                    <property name="toolTip">
                     <string>&lt;b&gt;Discard satellites under eclipse condition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This parameter allows to activate the discard of satellites if they are under eclipse conditions:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;They do not have direct visibility of the Sun&lt;br&gt;or&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;They have been in the former condition at some time of the last 30 minutes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
