                    <property name="toolTip">
                     <string>&lt;b&gt;Compare Satellite Clock Correction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compare the clock offsets of the two different files. If this option is disabled, only the orbits are compared. Thus, the result of the clock comparison field is set to zero. This option is useful when one of the &lt;b&gt;SP3&lt;/b&gt; files contains 9999 values for the satellite clocks.</string>
