                           <string>&lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt; (Move Left)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Move left the current selected cell (navigation message type). The further to the left side the cell (navigation message type) is, the higher priority the navigation message type has.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The order of selection of navigation message type is for computing orbits and clocks. See &lt;i&gt;Preferred age time&lt;/i&gt; below for details on the navigation message selection algorithm.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; Cells in red mean that the selected navigation message type will not be used. To unselect (turn red) a navigation message type, double click on a cell. Double clicking again will undo the navigation message type unselection.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                          </property>
                          <property name="text">
                           <string>&lt;&lt;</string>
                          </property>
                         </widget>
                        </item>
                        <item row="0" column="1">
