                    <property name="toolTip">
                     <string>&lt;b&gt;Precise orbit and clocks (2 files)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Selects as orbit and clock products source an &lt;b&gt;SP3&lt;/b&gt; file (for orbits) and a &lt;b&gt;CLK&lt;/b&gt; file (for clocks). These files contain the orbits and clocks of the satellite at specific times. The use of a &lt;b&gt;CLK&lt;/b&gt; file provides a higher rate of the clocks, and thence a higher rate processing step. The orbit and clock interpolation degrees in the &lt;i&gt;Modelling&lt;/i&gt; section affects the computation of orbit and clocks in this mode.&lt;br&gt;</string>
                    </property>
