                           <string>&lt;b&gt;Start Time&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the first epoch (in GPS time) for computing orbital data. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; In the GUI, the date format is fixed, but in command line there are four different date formats:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;YYYYMMDD HH:MM:SS (in 24 hour format)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;YYYY/MM/DD HH:MM:SS (in 24 hour format)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;YYYY/DoY SoD&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;GPSWeek SoW&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
                          </property>
