  <action name="actionPPP">
   <property name="checkable">
    <bool>true</bool>
   </property>
   <property name="text">
    <string>PPP</string>
   </property>
   <property name="toolTip">
    <string>&lt;b&gt;PPP default configuration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Selects all the options to perform a regular Precise Point Positioning (PPP) processing for the computation of precise coordinates. Only the following items are necessary for a complete run:&lt;ul &gt;&lt;li&gt;RINEX observation file from a station.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ANTEX file for precise satellite and receiver antenna data.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SP3 file for the same day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
   </property>
   <property name="shortcut">
    <string>F2</string>
   </property>
  </action>
  <action name="actionSBAS_1F">
   <property name="checkable">
    <bool>true</bool>
   </property>
   <property name="text">
    <string>SBAS 1F</string>
   </property>
   <property name="toolTip">
    <string>&lt;b&gt;SBAS default configuration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Selects all the options to perform a regular SBAS processing. Only the following items are necessary for a complete run:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;RINEX observation file from a station.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Broadcast navigation message file for the same day.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SBAS message file from a station.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
   </property>
   <property name="shortcut">
    <string>F3</string>
   </property>
  </action>
  <action name="actionDGNSS">
   <property name="checkable">
    <bool>true</bool>
   </property>
   <property name="text">
    <string>DGNSS</string>
   </property>
   <property name="toolTip">
    <string>&lt;b&gt;DGNSS default configuration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Selects all the options to perform a regular diffrential (DGNSS) processing. Only the following items are necessary for a complete run:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;RINEX observation file from a station.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Broadcast navigation message file for the same day.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;RINEX observation or RTCM file from a reference station.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</string>
   </property>
   <property name="shortcut">
    <string>F5</string>
   </property>
   <property name="menuRole">
    <enum>QAction::NoRole</enum>
   </property>
  </action>
  <action name="actionLoad">
   <property name="text">
    <string>Load configuration file</string>
   </property>
   <property name="toolTip">
    <string>This button loads a gLAB configuration file.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In positioning mode, all parameters (including the ones which are for other modes) will be checked for errors.&lt;br&gt;In all other modes, only the necessary parameters will be read and checked, and the rest will be omitted.&lt;br&gt;</string>
   </property>
   <property name="shortcut">
    <string>Ctrl+L</string>
   </property>
  </action>
  <action name="actionSave">
   <property name="text">
    <string>Save configuration file</string>
   </property>
   <property name="toolTip">
    <string>This button saves all the parameters from the gLAB-GUI to a .cfg file, which can be read by the processing core by means of the '-input:cfg' parameter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In Linux:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;./gLAB_linux -input:cfg gLAB.cfg&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In Windows:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;gLAB.exe -input:cfg gLAB.cfg&lt;br&gt;</string>
   </property>
   <property name="shortcut">
    <string>Ctrl+S</string>
   </property>
  </action>
  <action name="actionShow">
   <property name="enabled">
    <bool>false</bool>
   </property>
   <property name="text">
